+| 19 | Parse robustness (`toml`): `toml::from_str::<Value>` never panics on arbitrary text or TOML-shaped soup. | `value::from_str_value_never_panics` | Sibling of #6 on the separate `crates/toml/src/de` code path. |
+| 20 | Deep-nesting robustness (`toml`): nested arrays/dotted keys/bracket soup swept to depth 4096 error gracefully with the same `LIMIT = 80` boundary. | `value::deeply_nested_documents_error_gracefully` | `const LIMIT: u32 = 80` in `crates/toml/src/de/parser/mod.rs:71`. |
